awcc (26.9.23-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Key bindings: config-driven table keyed by measured EV_MSC scan codes,
    plus a real key-bindings page in ALIENFX
  * Daemon owns the state (mode / brightness / bindings) and pushes changes to
    subscribed clients, so the GUI follows changes made by hotkeys
  * Fixed: the three mode rows on home / performance pages were independent
  * Fixed: an empty msgid passed to makeLabel() rendered the whole .po header

 -- Felix <noreply@example.com>  Tue, 23 Sep 2026 09:00:00 +0800

awcc (26.9.22-3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * GTK4 frontend replacing the upstream ImGui UI
  * Official AWCC layout and colours sampled from the reference screenshots
  * Automatic zh_CN / English switching (gettext)
  * Configurable background (pure black / follow system / colour / image)
  * Icon scaling follows the window size; rail icons ink-compensated
  * Date-based versioning: v<YY>.<M>.<D>-<n>
  * Packages now built by Forgejo Actions from this tag; the previous tag's source
    archive lacked the COMPONENT markers the package installs filter on

 -- Felix <noreply@example.com>  Mon, 22 Sep 2026 16:00:00 +0800
